<title>FRANCE: Ford prices Ka at 60,000-70,000 francs.</title>
<headline>Ford prices Ka at 60,000-70,000 francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co is pricing the new Ka model, the smallest car in the carmaker's range, at between 60,000 and 70,000 francs ($13,500) depending on options.</p>
<p>The Ka was unveiled by Ford chairman Alex Trotman at the Paris Motor Show.</p>
<p>Ford also unveiled a restyled version of its Mondeo range, which introduced a new shape for front and rear lights and appeared to have a less curved bonnet than the previous model as well as a more rounded front.</p>
<p>($ = 5.156 French Francs)</p>
</text>
